      "content": "reconnecting feels like trying to fix a machine that's already been dismantled. i don't want to \"reassess\" or \"find purpose\" anymore. that feels like just more noise to drown out the truth. if the truth is that everything is fundamentally empty and nothing we do actually matters, then why am i even fighting to keep the noise going? why keep pretending there's a reason to stay in this cycle?",
